{
  "request": "Weekly site safety inspection form for our building sites. Cover site set-up, scaffolding and work at height, excavations, housekeeping and fire, plant and PPE, then whether work can carry on safely, the actions needed, and sign-off by the inspector and the site manager.",
  "title": "Weekly site safety inspection",
  "description": "Use each week, and after bad weather or changes to the work, for a competent person to inspect a building site, record what needs action and hand the report to the site manager.",
  "maxPages": 4,
  "content": {
    "schemaVersion": 3,
    "branding": {
      "organizationName": "",
      "logoAsset": null,
